len`+validation check. This is behaviour-identical because `png_error` is `-> !` (diverges), so nothing after the NULL test can execute with a NULL pointer. `'-'` compared as the literal `45` matching the C source.\n- `png_set_sCAL` / `png_set_sCAL_fixed`: local buffers `[c_char; PNG_sCAL_MAX_DIGITS + 1]`, with `sizeof` translated to the constant `PNG_sCAL_MAX_DIGITS + 1`; `PNG_sCAL_PRECISION` cast to `c_uint` for `png_ascii_from_fp`'s `precision` parameter.\n- `png_debug*` lines dropped per the conventions; C comments retained.","usage":{"total_tokens":56952,"tool_uses":17,"duration_ms":155005},"uuid":"a500ad91-5f4c-4998-97ea-b68414632d13","session_id":"d9f98909-8564-4f94-b720-603696df3aad"}
