fficients and sets\n  `png_ptr->rgb_to_gray_red_coeff` / `_green_coeff` /\n  `rgb_to_gray_coefficients_set`; reproduce every check and warning.\n* `png_set_gamma_fixed` uses `translate_gamma_flags`/`convert_gamma_value`?  Read\n  the C source; it may call `png_fixed`.  Follow the source exactly.\n* `png_set_rgb_to_gray(png_ptr, error_action: c_int, red: f64, green: f64)`.","agentId":"afc20ee476e7a63dc","agentType":"general-purpose","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. `src/gen/pngrtran_p03.rs` (278 lines) now holds the translation of `c_src/src/pngrtran.c` lines 893..1176.\n\nFunctions translated, in C source order:\n1. `png_set_gamma_fixed` — exported; uses `translate_gamma_flags`, `unsupported_gamma`, `png_app_error`, writes `file_gamma`/`screen_gamma`.\n2. `png_set_gamma` — exported; wraps the fixed variant via `convert_gamma_value`.\n3. `png_set_expand`\n4. `png_set_palette_to_rgb`\n5. `png_set_expand_gray_1_2_4_to_8`\n6. `png_set_tRNS_to_alpha`\n7. `png_set_expand_16`\n8. `png_set_gray_to_rgb`\n9. `png_set_rgb_to_gray_fixed` — full `error_action` match (with `png_error` default), `PNG_EXPAND` for palette color type, and both coefficient branches (`red >= 0 && green >= 0 && red + green <= PNG_FP_1` sets `rgb_to_gray_red_coeff`/`_green_coeff`/`rgb_to_gray_coefficients_set`; otherwise the out-of-range `png_app_warning`).\n10. `png_set_rgb_to_gray` — exported; `red: f64, green: f64` converted with `png_fixed`.\n11. `png_set_read_user_transform_fn`\n12. `png_gamma_threshold` — module-private `unsafe fn`, returns the `png_muldiv`-failure-or-significant boolean as `c_int`.\n\nNotes:\n- `png_set_gamma_fixed` uses `translate_gamma_flags`/`unsupported_gamma`; only `png_set_gamma` (the float API) uses `convert_gamma_value`, matching the C source. `png_fixed` is only used by `png_set_rgb_to_gray`.\n- `png_set_rgb_to_gray_fixed` coefficient math preserved verbatim as `((red as png_uint_32).wrapping_mul(32768)) / 100000` cast to `png_uint_16` (no rounding, as the C commen