efine `__GNUC__`); it type-checks because `png_error` is `-> !`.\n- `PNG_FORMAT_AFIRST_SUPPORTED` / `PNG_FORMAT_BGR_SUPPORTED` are both defined in `pnglibconf.h`, so `afirst` and `bgr` are computed as locals rather than the `#define ... 0` fallbacks.\n- Both fall-through switches in `png_create_colormap_entry` (case 4 -> 3 and 2 -> 1, in both the `P_LINEAR` `png_uint_16p` and `P_sRGB` `png_bytep` branches) were made explicit by duplicating the shared body into each arm.\n- Chained assignments (`blue = red = green = y;`, `red = green = blue = 0;`) were expanded in C's right-to-left order.\n- Return values of `png_gamma_16bit_correct` (`png_uint_16`) and `PNG_sRGB_FROM_LINEAR` (`png_byte`) are cast up to `png_uint_32`, matching C's implicit widening; `png_sRGB_table` lookups likewise.\n- All arithmetic on `png_uint_32` uses `wrapping_*`; the two `/65535u32` divisions are left verbatim (constant divisor, no panic path).\n- No re-definition of `PNG_GRAY_COLORMAP_ENTRIES`, `PNG_GA_COLORMAP_ENTRIES`, `PNG_RGB_COLORMAP_ENTRIES`, `PNG_DIV51`, `PNG_RGB_INDEX`, or `png_image_read_control` — those already live in `src/pngread.rs`. No `use`/`mod`/inner attributes in the part file."}],"resolvedModel":"global.anthropic.claude-opus-5[1m]","totalDurationMs":206118,"totalTokens":64610,"totalToolUseCount":18,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":331,"cache_read_input_tokens":63358,"output_tokens":918,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":331},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":9,"searchCount":0,"bashCount":8,"editFileCount":1,"linesAdded":477,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
